        {
          "text": "Otalikora kubi omunyaihanga; omanyire omutima gw'omunyaihanga nkooku guteekereza, habwokuba na inywe mukaba muli banyamahanga omunsi Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.9",
