              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebirukukira oburungi eby'omuganuro ebi oraayezaaga omwitaka lyawe, obitege omu nju ya MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe.",
          "type": "text",
